11. Algorithm
Patient Registration Algorithm
1. Start
2. Enter patient details.
3. Select department.
4. Check emergency status.
5. If emergency, assign priority 1.
6. Else if age >= 60, assign priority 2.
7. Otherwise assign priority 3.
8. Generate token number.
9. Add patient to queue.
10. Display patient token.
11. Stop.
Calling Next Patient
1. Check whether a patient is already In Progress.
2. If yes, display an error.
3. Otherwise find all Waiting patients.
4. Sort patients by priority.
5. If priority is equal, compare token number.
6. Select the first patient.
7. Change status to In Progress.
8. Display patient information.
